{
    // Escaped CP850 characters preserve the event substitution tokens.
    "25": "A diplomat in \u00e6\u00c6 Empire was caught planning an assassination attempt on a top official in \u00c5\u00c9 Empire. Diplomatic relations between the two empires have been severely weakened.",
    "29": "A diplomatic marriage between \u00c5\u00c9 ambassador and a top member of \u00e6\u00c6 military occurred today. Diplomatic relations between the two empires have been greatly improved.",
    "37": "A violent earthquake hit \u00c5\u00c9 colony of \u00c7, killing \u00fc million colonists and destroying \u00e9 building\u00e4.",
    "49": "A major industrial accident on \u00c7 has irradiated the entire planet. The intense radiation levels have killed millions of civilians in \u00c5\u00c9 colony.",
    "53": "Due to overworking by \u00c9 miners, the mineral classification of \u00c7 colony was lowered to \u00ee.",
    "57": "Workers in \u00c5\u00c9 Empire discovered a previously unknown deposit of minerals on \u00c7 that improved the mineral classification of that planet to \u00ee.",
    "74": "The plague continues on \u00c7. Thousands of colonists died last year. Scientists in \u00c5\u00c9 Empire believe that they are \u00fc research point\u00e2 away from perfecting a cure.",
    "77": "There are hundreds of new citizens in \u00c5\u00c9 Empire, as a sudden population boom on \u00c7 has doubled the population growth rate of the colony.",
    "81": "While carrying out secret high-level experiments, \u00c9 scientists stumbled upon the secret of \u00e5.",
    "86": "In a glorious battle, the alien Space Amoeba was destroyed by \u00c5\u00c9 military.",
    "88": "The Space Amoeba engulfed the colony of \u00c7. The planet will forever have a toxic environment.",
    "92": "The Space Crystal has killed millions of \u00c9 colonists on \u00c7. The colony's structures remained intact, as lifeless monuments to the dead.",
    "94": "Ships under \u00c9 command have succeeded in destroying the monstrous Space Dragon.",
    "96": "Citizens in \u00c5\u00c9 Empire mourn for family killed by the Space Dragon attack on \u00c7.",
    "104": "A violent attack on \u00c7 by the giant Space Hydra has left millions of \u00c9 citizens dead.",
    "105": "Scientists predict that the star in the \u00ef system will go supernova within \u00fc year\u00e2. If a research solution cannot be found, colonies in the system will be destroyed.",
    "106": "Scientists have only \u00fc year\u00e2 to prevent the \u00ef star from going supernova. \u00e9 more research point\u00e4 should bring a solution.",
    "107": "Scientists in the \u00ef system have developed a solar rejuvenator that has ended the threat of their star going supernova.",
    "108": "The \u00ef star has gone supernova, destroying most of the system and killing millions.",
    "111": "The spacetime anomaly that held the \u00ef star system frozen in time has ended. Contact has been reestablished, and colony production has returned to normal.",
    "112": "A spacetime anomaly has occurred in the \u00ef star system. All colonies in that system are unable to build, and ships are unable to make contact for either trade or combat purposes.",
    "115": "The threat of the hyperspace beast has ended. All space fleets may travel in hyperspace without fear once again.",
    "119": "The fleet trapped in the hyperspace warp funnel has worked its way out. All of \u00c5\u00c9 ships appear undamaged, and all crew members survived the ordeal.",
